        "## Task 5: Conclusion & Future Work\n",
        "\n",
        "### Conclusion\n",
        "\n",
        "Based on the performance metrics and visualizations:\n",
        "\n",
        "*   **CNN Model:** Achieved a test accuracy of `0.8847` and a test loss of `0.5970`. The training plots indicate that the CNN model quickly achieved high training accuracy and low training loss, but its validation loss started to increase after a few epochs, suggesting it began to overfit the training data. This implies that while it learned the training patterns very well, it struggled slightly more to generalize to unseen data than initially indicated by its training performance.\n",
